Being healthy is the first thing we need to keep in mind. We do not need a fancy car, big apartment, a engineering degree without a health. In recent years, the gym industry in our country has experienced rapid growth. We visited many gyms and found that, except for a few, most of them are managed manually. We have done a project on Gym Management and database management. This system is proposed to be an automate database management & transactions. This stores employee, trainer, member, member progress, payment history, receipts, products information and sales history. The software aims to provide an easy-to-use system for gym managers to handle customer relationships and store facility and staff data.
